    <p class="adt-body text-left leading-relaxed">
      <span data-id="pg092_n0043">Buna: Uaaa, nuk e kam ditur q&#xeb; vendi yn&#xeb; ka kaq shum&#xeb; pasuri natyrore.</span>
      <span data-id="pg092_n0044">Faleminderit, Rita!</span>
      <span data-id="pg092_n0045">Besoj q&#xeb; me k&#xeb;to informacione artikulli im do t&#xeb; informoj&#xeb; shum&#xeb; njer&#xeb;z p&#xeb;r pasurit&#xeb; tona natyrore!</span>
    </p>
